{"id":55157,"date":"2026-07-28T08:27:02","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T07:27:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55157"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:32:07","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:32:07","slug":"trail-camara-de-lobos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-camara-de-lobos\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail C\u00e2mara de Lobos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail C\u00e2mara de Lobos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XIII Trail de C\u00e2mara de Lobos 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no fant\u00e1stico anfiteatro natural do concelho de <strong>C\u00e2mara de Lobos<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha da Madeira<\/strong>. Promovido em conjunto pela <strong>ACD Jardim da Serra<\/strong> e pela <strong>ACR do Estreito<\/strong>, com a chancela oficial da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira (AARAM)<\/strong>, o evento integra o prestigiado circuito regional <strong>Trail Madeira<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com chegada comum no <strong>Mercado Municipal do Estreito<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o arranca com o <strong>Ultra Trail de 40 km (+2.300m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07:00<\/strong> (partida no Curral das Freiras), o <strong>Trail Longo de 27 km (+1.200m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08:30 (Jardim da Serra) e o <strong>Trail Curto de 15 km (+800m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:00 (Cais de C\u00e2mara de Lobos). Os percursos atravessam as cinco freguesias do concelho e passagens pelos vales de S\u00e3o Vicente e Ribeira Brava, com almo\u00e7o quente servido \u00e0 chegada.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:00<\/span><\/li>\n<l